🔁 3. Character Count / Frequency Map

Used when you need to compare anagrams, build histograms, or count occurrences.

💡 Example: 242. Valid Anagram

public boolean isAnagram(String s, String t) {
    if (s.length() != t.length()) return false;

    int[] count = new int[26];
    for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {
        count[s.charAt(i) - 'a']++;
        count[t.charAt(i) - 'a']--;
    }

    for (int c : count) {
        if (c != 0) return false;
    }

    return true;
}


