🔁 4. Reversing a String or Part of It

💡 Example: 344. Reverse String

public void reverseString(char[] s) {
    int left = 0, right = s.length - 1;
    while (left < right) {
        char temp = s[left];
        s[left++] = s[right];
        s[right--] = temp;
    }
}


